WEBVTT

00:07.448 --> 00:08.758
- Are you ready, kids?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:08.827 --> 00:10.413
Kids:
Aye, aye, Captain!
孩子们：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:10.482 --> 00:11.931
- I can't hear you.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:12.000 --> 00:14.034
Kids:
Aye, aye, Captain!
孩子们：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:14.103 --> 00:17.000
- ♪ Ohh... ♪
- ♪ 哦...♪

00:17.068 --> 00:19.034
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:19.103 --> 00:21.103
Kids:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
孩子们：
海绵宝宝！

00:21.172 --> 00:22.931
- ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
- ♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的 ♪

00:23.000 --> 00:24.896
kids:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
孩子们：
海绵宝宝！

00:24.965 --> 00:27.068
- ♪ If nautical nonsense
be something you wish ♪
- ♪ 如果航海废话
成为你想要的东西♪

00:27.137 --> 00:29.137
kids:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
孩子们：
海绵宝宝！

00:29.206 --> 00:31.079
- ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
- ♪ 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:31.103 --> 00:33.034
kids: SpongeBob SquarePants!
- Ready?
孩子们：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:33.103 --> 00:34.827
All:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:34.896 --> 00:37.172
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:37.241 --> 00:39.103
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:39.172 --> 00:40.379
- SpongeBob
- 海绵宝宝

00:40.448 --> 00:42.275
SquarePants!
方裤！

00:42.344 --> 00:45.034
[laughing]
[笑]

00:45.103 --> 00:47.275
[flute plays]
[长笛演奏]

00:47.344 --> 00:48.724
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

00:50.344 --> 00:53.241
[rock music]
[摇滚乐]

00:53.310 --> 01:00.275
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

01:00.344 --> 01:05.862
- Look, all I'm saying is there
are rules to surviving horror,
- 看，我要说的都在那里
是恐怖生存的规则，

01:05.931 --> 01:10.103
like to go off alone, don't
say "I'll be right back,"
喜欢一个人走，不
说“我马上回来”

01:10.172 --> 01:11.862
and no canoodling.
也不许亲热。

01:11.931 --> 01:14.275
- And don't be ridiculous.
- 别开玩笑了。

01:14.344 --> 01:16.620
You're all acting like
a bunch of babies.
你们都表现得像
一群婴儿。

01:16.689 --> 01:21.034
I'm not afraid of any creature
or axe murderer or whatever.
我不惧怕任何生物
或斧头杀人犯或其他什么。

01:21.103 --> 01:25.758
If anything scary came at me,
I'd hit 'em like this,
如果有什么可怕的事情向我袭来
我会这样打他们

01:25.827 --> 01:27.206
and I'd hit 'em like that!
我会那样打他们！

01:27.275 --> 01:28.206
- Bleh!
- 哎呀！

01:28.275 --> 01:29.275
- [yelps]
- [尖叫声]

01:29.310 --> 01:31.172
[laughter]
[笑声]

01:32.551 --> 01:34.310
Very funny, Karen.
非常有趣，凯伦。

01:34.379 --> 01:37.620
Very funny.
很搞笑。

01:37.689 --> 01:39.068
Come on, chuckles.
来吧，笑声。

01:39.137 --> 01:43.206
Let's blow this weenie
roast and canoodle.
让我们吹这个威尼
烤和煮。

01:43.275 --> 01:46.724
- I wouldn't do
that if I were you.
- 我不会做
如果我是你。

01:46.793 --> 01:49.413
- You wouldn't do anything
I would do, weirdo.
- 你什么也不会做
我愿意，怪人。

01:49.482 --> 01:50.517
- Mmm.
- 嗯。

01:50.586 --> 01:51.862
S'mores.
羊肚菌。

01:51.931 --> 01:54.862
- You know that's
a pine cone, right?
- 你知道那是
松果，对吗？

01:54.931 --> 01:58.000
- S'more pine cone for me!
- 给我更多松果！

02:01.241 --> 02:03.793
[burps]
Mmm.
[打嗝]
嗯。

02:03.862 --> 02:06.000
Spicy little devil.
麻辣小恶魔。

02:06.068 --> 02:07.172
[chuckles]
[笑声]

02:07.241 --> 02:08.275
- Ugh!
- 呃！

02:08.344 --> 02:10.241
Maybe we should
tell stories to keep
也许我们应该
讲故事以保留

02:10.310 --> 02:13.758
our minds off the terrifying
horror that lurks in the dark.
我们的思想远离了可怕的事情
潜伏在黑暗中的恐怖。

02:13.827 --> 02:15.344
- Ooh, I'll start.
- 哦，我要开始了。

02:15.413 --> 02:19.655
It was a night just like
tonight, in an old abandoned
那是一个夜晚，就像
今晚，在一处废弃的旧屋里

02:19.724 --> 02:22.068
camp just like this one.
就像这个营地一样。

02:22.137 --> 02:25.448
But there was something
out there, something spooky
但有件事
那里有一些令人毛骨悚然的东西

02:25.517 --> 02:27.448
that prowled in the woods.
在树林里徘徊的。

02:27.517 --> 02:28.586
- Seriously?
- 严重地？

02:28.655 --> 02:30.862
A scary camping story?
一个可怕的露营故事？

02:30.931 --> 02:33.448
- It's the only story
I can remember right now.
- 这是唯一的故事
我现在就记得。

02:33.517 --> 02:38.068
- Ooh, tell the part with
all the bloody axe-murdering!
- 哦，告诉这部分
所有该死的斧头谋杀！

02:38.137 --> 02:39.413
Both: No!
两人：不！

02:39.482 --> 02:41.137
- All right, that's it!
- 好吧，就是这样！

02:41.206 --> 02:42.551
No more campfire.
不再有篝火。

02:42.620 --> 02:45.241
We're all going to stay
together in the old Dingy Cabin
我们都会留下来
一起在肮脏的旧小屋里

02:45.310 --> 02:46.310
until morning.
直到早上。

02:46.344 --> 02:47.620
- Good idea.
- 好主意。

02:47.689 --> 02:49.655
I'll go get Plankton and Karen.
我去去找浮游生物和凯伦。

02:49.724 --> 02:52.482
I'll be right back.
我马上回来。

02:52.551 --> 02:54.000
- She's dead.
- 她死了。

02:55.241 --> 02:56.241
- Aw.
- 噢。

02:56.310 --> 02:59.379
Our old cabin.
我们的旧小屋。

02:59.448 --> 03:00.931
It's a fixer-upper.
这是一个固定鞋面。

03:01.000 --> 03:03.758
- More like a tearer-downer.
- 更像是催泪弹。

03:03.827 --> 03:06.310
- I call top bunk.
- 我打电话给上铺。

03:06.379 --> 03:08.275
[door squeaks]
[门吱吱作响]

03:10.000 --> 03:11.862
- SpongeBob, I think
there's someone
- 海绵宝宝，我想
有人

03:11.931 --> 03:14.379
sleeping in this bunk bed.
睡在这张双层床上。

03:14.448 --> 03:18.206
[all whimpering]
[全都呜咽]

03:18.275 --> 03:19.275
- [yelps]
- [尖叫声]

03:19.344 --> 03:20.344
[sea urchins growling]
[海胆咆哮]

03:20.379 --> 03:25.413
[all screaming]
[所有人尖叫]

03:25.482 --> 03:28.862
[sea urchins
imitating conga line chant]
[海胆
模仿康加线圣歌]

03:28.931 --> 03:32.448
- [imitating conga line chant]
- [模仿康加线圣歌]

03:32.517 --> 03:33.689
[yelps]
[尖叫声]

03:33.758 --> 03:37.827
- [panting] Can I faint now?
- [气喘吁吁]我现在可以晕倒吗？

03:37.896 --> 03:39.379
- Be my guest.
- 做我的客人。

03:39.448 --> 03:41.517
- [gasping]
- [喘气]

03:41.586 --> 03:45.379
- Uh, what do I do with this?
- 呃，我该怎么办？

03:45.448 --> 03:50.517
[wolves howling]
[狼嚎]

03:50.586 --> 03:52.724
[kissing noises]
[接吻声]

03:52.793 --> 03:53.689
- Whoo!
- 呼！

03:53.758 --> 03:54.758
Yes!
是的！

03:54.827 --> 03:56.965
I made it to first base!
我到达一垒了！

03:57.034 --> 03:59.137
[electronic beeping]
[电子蜂鸣声]

03:59.206 --> 04:02.517
Huh?
啊？

04:02.586 --> 04:04.103
[both scream]
[两人尖叫]

04:06.034 --> 04:08.206
- Oh, there you are.
- 哦，你来了。

04:08.275 --> 04:09.275
Hello.
你好。

04:09.310 --> 04:10.068
[chuckles]
[笑声]

04:10.137 --> 04:12.586
- What is wrong with you?
- 你怎么了？

04:12.655 --> 04:14.000
I almost had a heart attack!
我差点心脏病发作！

04:14.068 --> 04:16.000
And what's with the mask?
面具又是怎么回事？

04:16.068 --> 04:18.517
- Oh, don't be so dramatic.
-哦，别这么戏剧化。

04:18.586 --> 04:22.931
I just found some of my old
hockey equipment in the woods.
我刚刚找到了一些旧的
树林里的曲棍球设备。

04:23.000 --> 04:25.413
It's still got my name on it.
上面仍然有我的名字。

04:25.482 --> 04:27.275
Good times.
美好时光。

04:27.344 --> 04:29.310
[both yelp]
[两人都尖叫]

04:29.379 --> 04:30.620
- Plankton?
- 浮游生物？

04:30.689 --> 04:32.137
Karen?
凯伦？

04:32.206 --> 04:36.551
Come on, I know you're
just trying to scare me.
来吧，我知道你是
只是想吓唬我。

04:36.620 --> 04:38.482
Holy Zamboni!
圣赞博尼！

04:38.551 --> 04:39.551
[shrieks]
[尖叫声]

04:39.586 --> 04:41.586
- [cackling]
- [咯咯笑]

04:41.655 --> 04:43.034
- All right, so where was I?
- 好吧，那我刚才说到哪儿了？

04:43.103 --> 04:45.172
Oh, yeah, I remember now.
哦，是的，我现在想起来了。

04:45.241 --> 04:48.068
There was something
spooky out there
有东西
外面很诡异

04:48.137 --> 04:49.931
prowling around in the woods.
在树林里徘徊。

04:50.000 --> 04:53.896
And it made a terrifying shriek!
并且发出了恐怖的惨叫声！

04:53.965 --> 04:56.620
[clarinet screeching]
[单簧管尖叫声]

04:56.689 --> 04:58.586
[all whimpering]
[全都呜咽]

04:58.655 --> 04:59.655
- Ugh!
- 呃！

04:59.724 --> 05:01.551
I'm tired of being scared.
我厌倦了害怕。

05:01.620 --> 05:02.620
- Me too.
- 我也是。

05:02.689 --> 05:04.862
Both: Me too.
两人：我也是。

05:04.931 --> 05:08.379
- Uh, I'm not tired
of being scared yet.
- 呃，我不累
还害怕。

05:08.448 --> 05:09.655
- Come on, fellers.
- 来吧，伙计们。

05:09.724 --> 05:11.793
It's time we fought back!
我们是时候反击了！

05:11.862 --> 05:14.137
[clarinet screeching]
[单簧管尖叫声]

05:14.206 --> 05:17.206
- [yelps]
The... Creeper.
- [尖叫声]
……爬行者。

05:17.275 --> 05:18.551
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

05:18.620 --> 05:20.000
- Hi-yah!
- 嗨呀！

05:20.068 --> 05:23.275
[both grunting]
[两人都咕哝着]

05:23.344 --> 05:24.517
- Ohh!
- 哦！

05:24.586 --> 05:26.206
[groans]
[呻吟]

05:26.275 --> 05:28.413
[together]
Squidward?
[一起]
章鱼哥？

05:28.482 --> 05:29.862
Ow!
噢！

05:29.931 --> 05:31.068
All: Patrick.
全体：帕特里克.

05:31.137 --> 05:32.257
- At least Squidward's safe.
- 至少章鱼哥安全了。

05:32.310 --> 05:34.000
[chuckles]
[笑声]

05:35.379 --> 05:38.206
- Ow!
- 噢！

05:38.275 --> 05:39.793
You guys?
你们？

05:41.241 --> 05:44.379
What are you idiots doing here?
你们这些白痴在这里做什么？

05:44.448 --> 05:46.724
- We're here
for the Kamp Koral reunion.
- 我们在这里
参加 Kamp Koral 聚会。

05:46.793 --> 05:48.517
Aren't you?
- Reunion?
你不是吗？
- 重聚？

05:48.586 --> 05:50.275
No.
不。

05:50.344 --> 05:53.517
I've been here for a week ever
since I was banned from playing
我已经在这里呆了一个星期了
自从我被禁止玩游戏以来

05:53.586 --> 05:55.620
clarinet in Bikini Bottom.
比基尼泳裤中的单簧管。

05:55.689 --> 05:58.758
- The city has been
rather peaceful lately.
- 这座城市已经
最近比较平静。

05:58.827 --> 06:00.862
- Didn't you notice
that I haven't
- 你没注意到吗
我还没有

06:00.931 --> 06:03.068
been at work for a whole week?
已经工作了一整周？

06:03.137 --> 06:05.344
- I assumed you were
just on a bathroom break.
- 我以为你是
刚刚上厕所休息。

06:05.413 --> 06:07.034
[chuckles]
[笑声]

06:07.103 --> 06:09.379
- You must have
gotten an invite.
- 你必须有
收到了邀请。

06:09.448 --> 06:11.758
- Hold on.
- 坚持，稍等。

06:11.827 --> 06:14.068
I believe this is yours.
我相信这是你的。

06:14.137 --> 06:16.241
- Huh.
[clam squawking]
- 嗯。
[蛤蜊叫声]

06:16.310 --> 06:19.206
This letter is for
Old Man Walker.
这封信是为了
沃克老人。

06:19.275 --> 06:21.241
He never even went to this camp.
他甚至从未去过这个营地。

06:21.310 --> 06:24.310
You idiots ruined
my perfect getaway.
你们这些白痴毁了
我的完美假期。

06:24.379 --> 06:28.034
Now I have to get away
again, all over again.
现在我必须离开
再次，一切重来。

06:28.827 --> 06:29.827
Ow!
噢！

06:29.896 --> 06:31.758
[sighs]
Typical.
[叹气]
典型的。

06:31.827 --> 06:34.103
[sputters]
[溅射声]

06:34.172 --> 06:35.655
- No!
Wait!
- 不！
等待！

06:35.724 --> 06:37.965
Don't go out alone.
不要一个人出去。

06:38.931 --> 06:41.896
Squidward!
章鱼哥！

06:41.965 --> 06:43.482
It's too late.
太晚了。

06:43.551 --> 06:45.517
He's vanished.
他失踪了。

06:45.586 --> 06:47.724
- Everybody's vanished.
- 大家都消失了。

06:47.793 --> 06:49.724
- Everybody?
- 大家？

06:49.793 --> 06:50.793
Ah!
啊!

06:50.827 --> 06:52.000
SpongeBob!
海绵宝宝！

06:52.068 --> 06:54.655
Help, I'm vanishing!
救命啊，我快消失了！

06:54.724 --> 06:55.724
- Come on, Patrick.
- 来吧，帕特里克。

06:55.793 --> 06:57.724
Materialize.
实现。

06:57.793 --> 06:59.517
Are you OK, buddy?
你还好吗，伙计？

06:59.586 --> 07:00.655
- I don't know.
- 我不知道。

07:00.724 --> 07:02.862
I'm still processing.
我还在处理中。

07:02.931 --> 07:07.586
- Squidward was taken because
he ignored the rules of horror.
- 章鱼哥被带走是因为
他无视恐怖规则。

07:07.655 --> 07:10.448
- You mean, don't wear
white after Labor Day?
- 你的意思是，不穿
劳动节后变白？

07:10.517 --> 07:11.896
- Ugh!
- 呃！

07:11.965 --> 07:16.275
I repeat,
don't go off alone, don't say,
我再说一遍，
不要一个人走，不要说

07:16.344 --> 07:20.551
I'll be right back,
and absolutely no canoodling.
我马上回来，
绝对不能亲热。

07:20.620 --> 07:21.620
Watch.
手表。

07:21.655 --> 07:22.586
I'll prove it.
我会证明这一点。

07:22.655 --> 07:24.482
[makes kissing noises]
[发出接吻声]

07:24.551 --> 07:26.517
Oh, my pumpkin.
哦，我的南瓜。

07:26.586 --> 07:28.344
My little lump of sugar.
我的小糖块。

07:28.413 --> 07:30.758
Sweet honey pie.
甜甜的蜂蜜馅饼。

07:30.827 --> 07:33.103
- Did he say "honey pie"?
- 他说的是“蜂蜜派”吗？

07:33.172 --> 07:34.896
I'm hungry.
我饿了。

07:34.965 --> 07:36.827
- [kissing]
- [接吻]

07:36.896 --> 07:38.620
[yelps]
[尖叫声]

07:38.689 --> 07:40.206
[all screaming]
[所有人尖叫]

07:40.827 --> 07:42.206
- Augh.
- 噢。

07:42.275 --> 07:43.310
All: Oh.
全体：哦。

07:43.379 --> 07:46.620
- And that's why
you don't canoodle.
- 这就是为什么
你不会亲热。

07:46.689 --> 07:47.931
[yelps]
[尖叫声]

07:48.000 --> 07:49.206
[all screaming]
[所有人尖叫]

07:49.275 --> 07:50.896
- Stand back, y'all.
- 退后一点，你们。

07:50.965 --> 07:53.310
Hi-yah!
嗨呀！

07:53.379 --> 07:56.862
Whoever it is,
they're probably still close.
不管是谁，
他们可能还很接近。

07:56.931 --> 07:59.931
Let's get 'em.
让我们抓住他们。

08:00.000 --> 08:04.034
- [grumbling] Ugh, there must
be somewhere I can play without
- [抱怨] 呃，一定有
是我可以在没有的情况下玩耍的地方

08:04.103 --> 08:06.068
any annoying interruptions.
任何烦人的打扰。

08:06.137 --> 08:07.517
Huh?
啊？

08:07.586 --> 08:10.206
You imbeciles better
not be following me!
你个傻逼更好
别跟着我！

08:12.827 --> 08:14.655
[sighs]
[叹气]

08:16.172 --> 08:18.931
Those morons got me all jumpy.
那些白痴让我浑身紧张。

08:19.000 --> 08:20.413
[grunts]
[咕哝]

08:22.000 --> 08:23.586
Huh?
啊？

08:23.655 --> 08:26.137
[both boinging]
[双方都在轰鸣]

08:26.206 --> 08:29.137
I hate to admit it,
but that's pretty cute.
我不愿意承认，
但这很可爱。

08:29.206 --> 08:31.413
[bunnies giggling]
[兔子咯咯地笑]

08:31.482 --> 08:32.275
- Ow!
- 噢！

08:32.344 --> 08:33.620
I take it back!
我收回来！

08:33.689 --> 08:34.862
Bad bunnies!
坏兔子们！

08:34.931 --> 08:36.724
[grumbling]
[抱怨]

08:38.275 --> 08:41.551
Huh?
All right, who is it now?
啊？
好吧，现在是谁？

08:41.620 --> 08:44.793
I have a clarinet,
and I'm not afraid to use it.
我有一支单簧管
我并不害怕使用它。

08:44.862 --> 08:46.793
[clarinet blares]
[单簧管的声音]

08:49.758 --> 08:51.931
Guess I blew them away.
猜猜我把他们吹走了。

08:52.000 --> 08:53.793
[laughing]
[笑]

08:53.862 --> 08:55.206
[shrieks]
[尖叫声]

08:55.275 --> 08:57.206
- [cackling]
- [咯咯笑]

08:57.275 --> 08:59.413
- Squidward!
- 章鱼哥！

08:59.482 --> 09:00.931
Harvey!
哈维！

09:01.000 --> 09:02.689
- Mrs. Puff?
- 帕夫夫人？

09:02.758 --> 09:03.758
Mo?
莫？

09:03.793 --> 09:05.413
- Lady Upturn?
- 女士崛起？

09:05.482 --> 09:06.724
Daddy?
爸爸？

09:06.793 --> 09:08.068
- I'm hollering!
- 我在喊叫！

09:08.137 --> 09:09.344
I'm yelling!
我大喊大叫！

09:09.413 --> 09:10.310
[laid-back clarinet music]
[悠闲的单簧管音乐]

09:10.379 --> 09:11.310
- Did you hear that?
- 你听到了吗？

09:11.379 --> 09:12.448
Clarinet music.
单簧管音乐。

09:12.517 --> 09:14.034
It must be Squidward.
一定是章鱼哥。

09:14.103 --> 09:15.862
- [giggling]
- [咯咯笑]

09:15.931 --> 09:19.586
- Aw, it's just a snail.
- 噢，这只是一只蜗牛。

09:19.655 --> 09:22.586
- Yeah, I thought
it sounded too good.
- 是的，我想
听起来太好了。

09:22.655 --> 09:27.827
- I'll keep this safe until we
can give it back to Squidward.
- 我会保管好这个直到我们
可以把它还给章鱼哥。

09:27.896 --> 09:28.965
- Yeah.
- 是的。

09:29.034 --> 09:31.724
I doubt he'll want it back now.
我怀疑他现在会想要回来。

09:33.034 --> 09:35.448
- [sighs] I'm beat.
- [叹气]我被打败了。

09:35.517 --> 09:39.068
I think we should call off
the search until morning.
我想我们应该取消
搜索一直到早上。

09:39.137 --> 09:40.551
[gasps]
Guys!
[喘气]
伙计们！

09:40.620 --> 09:41.551
Guys!
伙计们！

09:41.620 --> 09:42.724
It got me.
它抓住了我。

09:42.793 --> 09:44.172
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

09:44.241 --> 09:46.620
[screams]
Help!
[尖叫声]
救命啊！

09:46.689 --> 09:49.000
[screaming]
[尖叫]

09:49.068 --> 09:51.000
- [cackling]
- [咯咯笑]

09:51.068 --> 09:53.034
[both panting]
[两人都气喘吁吁]

09:53.103 --> 09:54.655
- She's gone!
- Oh!
- 她走了！
- 哦！

09:54.724 --> 09:56.172
The Creeper's got her.
爬行者抓住了她。

09:56.241 --> 09:58.103
- [screaming]
- [尖叫]

09:58.172 --> 09:59.931
- Now it's got Patrick!
- 现在帕特里克来了！

10:00.000 --> 10:01.793
- It's coming from back there!
- 它是从后面传来的！

10:01.862 --> 10:03.137
[both panting]
[两人都气喘吁吁]

10:03.206 --> 10:04.206
- [screaming]
- [尖叫]

10:04.241 --> 10:06.758
- The old Trawler cabin!
- 旧拖网渔船小屋！

10:06.827 --> 10:09.068
[grunts]
[咕哝]

10:09.137 --> 10:10.137
- Patrick?
- 帕特里克？

10:10.206 --> 10:12.068
[both scream]
[两人尖叫]

10:13.724 --> 10:15.758
- What is up?
- 怎么了？

10:15.827 --> 10:17.068
- Was that you yelling?
- 是你在喊吗？

10:17.137 --> 10:18.793
- Yelling?
Oh!
- 大喊大叫？
哦！

10:18.862 --> 10:20.103
Yeah, yeah.
是啊是啊。

10:20.172 --> 10:24.068
Uh, I wanted
to warn you about, um...
呃，我想要
警告你，嗯...

10:24.137 --> 10:25.827
- This spiderweb?
- 这个蜘蛛网？

10:25.896 --> 10:28.241
- Uh, yeah!
- 呃，是的！

10:28.310 --> 10:29.862
- Aw, thanks, buddy.
- 噢，谢谢，伙计。

10:29.931 --> 10:31.275
[roaring]
[咆哮]

10:31.344 --> 10:34.827
[all whimpering]
[全都呜咽]

10:34.896 --> 10:36.724
- On the count of three, boys.
- 数到三，孩子们。

10:36.793 --> 10:38.620
1, 2, 3!
1、2、3！
1、2、3！
1、2、3！

10:38.689 --> 10:43.344
[all screaming]
[所有人尖叫]

10:43.413 --> 10:47.103
- [gasps] Of all the
screamers back in the day,
- [喘气] 在所有的
当年的尖叫声，

10:47.172 --> 10:49.586
you guys were the best.
你们是最棒的。

10:49.655 --> 10:50.655
- Huh?
- 啊？

10:50.689 --> 10:53.310
Big and Lil Roxie?
大罗克西和小罗克西？

10:53.379 --> 10:56.310
Or is it Little and Big Roxie?
或者是小洛克西和大洛克西？

10:56.379 --> 10:58.275
- Y'all switched places?
- 你们都换地方了？

10:58.344 --> 11:01.000
- It happens every
three moon cycles.
- 它发生在每个
三个月亮周期。

11:01.068 --> 11:02.862
- Turnabout is fair play.
- 逆转是公平竞争。

11:02.931 --> 11:04.793
- [sputtering]
- [溅射]

11:07.137 --> 11:09.965
- Good evening, everyone.
- 大家晚上好。

11:10.034 --> 11:12.103
Welcome to my parlor.
欢迎来到我的客厅。

11:12.172 --> 11:15.758
Snip! Snip! Snip!
剪断！剪断！剪断！

11:15.827 --> 11:17.068
- Howdy, Preda Tory.
- 你好，普雷达·托里。

11:17.137 --> 11:18.034
[thunder crashes]
[雷霆轰鸣]

11:18.103 --> 11:19.103
[all yelp]
[大家尖叫]

11:19.172 --> 11:20.793
[eerie organ music]
[诡异的管风琴音乐]

11:20.862 --> 11:25.172
- [screeching]
- [尖叫声]

11:25.241 --> 11:27.137
[hisses]
[嘶嘶声]

11:27.206 --> 11:28.793
- Kidferatu!
- 基德费拉图！

11:28.862 --> 11:30.448
All grown up.
都长大了。

11:30.517 --> 11:32.965
Good to see you're
still dead and well.
很高兴看到你
仍然死了而且很好。

11:33.034 --> 11:34.206
- [hisses]
- [嘶嘶声]

11:34.275 --> 11:36.965
- He's a count now.
- 他现在是伯爵了

11:37.034 --> 11:39.206
[squelching]
[压抑]

11:42.413 --> 11:45.310
- It's great
to see you guys again.
- 太棒了
再次见到你们。

11:48.275 --> 11:50.068
- Jimmy Blobfish?
- 吉米水滴鱼？

11:50.137 --> 11:51.137
You look...
你看起来...

11:51.172 --> 11:52.172
- Yeah, I know.
- 是的，我知道。

11:52.241 --> 11:53.172
I know.
我知道。

11:53.241 --> 11:54.586
I lost my looks.
我失去了容貌。

11:54.655 --> 11:57.655
I was much cuter
when I was young.
我更可爱
当我年轻的时候。

11:57.724 --> 12:01.241
- It's the delicious
insides that count.
- 这就是美味
重要的内部。

12:01.310 --> 12:02.896
- [munching]
- [咀嚼]

12:02.965 --> 12:07.310
Yeah, but his outside
isn't so bad, either.
是的，但是他的外面
也不错。

12:10.758 --> 12:13.793
He still tastes
like maple syrup.
他还是有味道
像枫糖浆。

12:16.655 --> 12:17.655
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

12:17.689 --> 12:18.827
I almost forgot.
我差点忘了。

12:18.896 --> 12:20.482
We're all in danger.
我们都处于危险之中。

12:20.551 --> 12:22.689
There's a Creeper in camp.
营地里有一只苦力怕。

12:22.758 --> 12:24.172
- A Creeper?
- 爬行者？

12:24.241 --> 12:26.965
- Sounds like
our kind of people.
- 听起来像
我们这样的人。

12:27.034 --> 12:28.034
[giggles]
[咯咯笑]

12:28.103 --> 12:29.793
- Y'all don't understand.
- 你们都不明白。

12:29.862 --> 12:33.689
He's been snatching up everyone
who's here for the reunion.
他已经把所有人都抢走了
谁来这里参加聚会。

12:33.758 --> 12:37.551
- This Creeper
sounds fascinating.
- 这个爬行者
听起来很有趣。

12:37.620 --> 12:39.896
- What do we gotta
do to get snatched?
- 我们要做什么
被抢怎么办？

12:39.965 --> 12:42.620
- Well, Harvey said
you have to break
- 哈维说
你必须打破

12:42.689 --> 12:44.724
one of the rules of horror.
恐怖规则之一。

12:44.793 --> 12:45.724
- That's easy.
- 这很容易。

12:45.793 --> 12:47.034
We know them all.
我们都认识他们。

12:47.103 --> 12:49.448
[together]
Ahh! Run!
[一起]
啊！跑步！

12:51.000 --> 12:52.413
- What are you doing?
- 你在干什么？

12:52.482 --> 12:54.275
- We'll be right back.
- 我们马上回来。

12:54.344 --> 12:57.103
- [hisses]
- [嘶嘶声]

12:57.172 --> 12:59.172
[together]
Hooray!
[一起]
万岁！

12:59.241 --> 13:02.862
- [panting]
- [气喘吁吁]

13:02.931 --> 13:04.206
They're gone.
他们走了。

13:04.275 --> 13:06.793
- Hmm.
- 唔。

13:06.862 --> 13:08.413
I got it!
我得到了它！

13:08.482 --> 13:11.241
I know who the Creeper is.
我知道爬行者是谁。

13:11.310 --> 13:12.517
Think about it.
想一想。

13:12.586 --> 13:15.344
Who used to prank us
all the time?
谁曾经恶作剧我们
一直吗？

13:15.413 --> 13:16.931
Both: Hmm.
两人：嗯。

13:17.000 --> 13:19.931
- Our old hill folk
friends, Narlene and Nobby!
- 我们的老山民
朋友们，纳琳和诺比！

13:20.000 --> 13:23.034
Both: Ohh.
两人：哦。

13:23.103 --> 13:26.827
- So I say it's time
for us to prank them back.
- 所以我说是时候了
让我们恶作剧回来。

13:29.379 --> 13:31.517
- Narlene's cabin
looks abandoned.
- 纳琳的小屋
看起来被遗弃了。

13:31.586 --> 13:33.241
- That's how it always looks.
- 看起来总是如此。

13:33.310 --> 13:35.137
It's shack chic.
这是小屋别致。

13:35.206 --> 13:36.206
They're in there.
他们就在那里。

13:36.275 --> 13:39.241
I can feel it in my tail.
我可以在我的尾巴上感觉到它。

13:39.310 --> 13:41.206
- I can taste it in your tail.
- 我可以在你的尾巴里尝到它的味道。

13:41.275 --> 13:42.206
[spits]
[吐口水]

13:42.275 --> 13:44.344
[grunts]
[咕哝]

13:45.172 --> 13:47.275
[both snoring]
[两人都打呼噜]

13:51.482 --> 13:52.965
- You got your pie?
- 你有馅饼吗？

13:53.034 --> 13:56.862
- It's here, in my pie hole.
- 就在这里，在我的馅饼洞里。

13:56.931 --> 13:59.448
- When Patrick wakes them
up with the clarinet,
- 当帕特里克叫醒他们时
与单簧管一起，

13:59.517 --> 14:00.896
let 'em have it.
让他们拥有吧。

14:03.655 --> 14:04.586
- [inhales deeply]
- [深吸一口气]

14:04.655 --> 14:06.482
[clarinet blaring]
[单簧管的声音]

14:06.551 --> 14:10.103
- Why didn't that work?
- 为什么那不起作用？

14:10.172 --> 14:12.482
Dummies?
傻瓜？

14:12.551 --> 14:14.034
Both: Grrr.
两人：呃。

14:14.103 --> 14:16.000
[both screaming]
[两人尖叫]

14:16.068 --> 14:17.000
- Huh?
- 啊？

14:17.068 --> 14:18.413
Whoa!
哇！

14:18.482 --> 14:20.172
- More decoys?
- 更多诱饵？

14:20.241 --> 14:21.241
- Patrick!
- 帕特里克！

14:21.275 --> 14:22.827
Help us.
帮助我们。

14:22.896 --> 14:24.965
- I got it.
- 我得到了它。

14:25.034 --> 14:27.482
[licking]
[舔]

14:27.551 --> 14:28.620
- Patrick?
- 帕特里克？

14:28.689 --> 14:32.586
[sighs]
Nobby, cut 'em down.
[叹气]
诺比，砍倒他们。

14:32.655 --> 14:35.103
[both grunt, groan]
[两人咕哝，呻吟]

14:35.172 --> 14:36.551
- Hoo-wee!
- 呼威！

14:36.620 --> 14:39.448
If'n it ain't the old
ding dong Dinghies.
如果不是旧的
叮咚小艇。

14:39.517 --> 14:41.965
What y'all doing
in our domicile?
你们在做什么
在我们的住所？

14:42.034 --> 14:43.655
- Like you don't know!
- 就像你不知道一样！

14:43.724 --> 14:45.758
You've been pranking
us all night!
你一直在恶作剧
我们整个晚上！

14:45.827 --> 14:46.827
- Ha!
- 哈！

14:46.862 --> 14:48.241
'Fraid not.
恐怕不会。

14:48.310 --> 14:50.217
We've been busy trying to
catch a critter that's been
我们一直在忙着尝试
抓住一只已经被

14:50.241 --> 14:51.827
trespassing on our property.
侵入我们的财产。

14:51.896 --> 14:54.655
That's why we rigged
the booby trap.
这就是我们操纵的原因
诱杀装置

14:54.724 --> 14:58.896
- Alas, the only boobies
we caught were you.
- 唉，唯一的胸部
我们抓住的是你。

14:58.965 --> 15:00.655
[chuckles]
[笑声]

15:00.724 --> 15:02.413
- I bet it was the Creeper.
- 我打赌那是苦力怕。

15:02.482 --> 15:04.551
He invited us to a camp reunion,
他邀请我们参加营地聚会，

15:04.620 --> 15:06.896
only to snatch everybody away.
只为抢走所有人。

15:06.965 --> 15:09.379
- How would you all
like to team up with us
- 你们会怎样
喜欢与我们合作

15:09.448 --> 15:11.275
and put a stop to this varmint?
并阻止这个害虫？

15:11.344 --> 15:14.448
- Does the tin-man have
a sheet-metal behind?
- 铁皮人有吗
后面有金属板吗？

15:14.517 --> 15:16.310
Time we armed up!
是时候我们武装起来了！

15:16.379 --> 15:18.482
[twangy banjo music]
[班卓琴音乐]

15:18.551 --> 15:21.344
- [grunts] Ha-ha!
- [咕哝]哈哈！

15:21.413 --> 15:22.413
- Hmm.
- 唔。

15:22.482 --> 15:24.862
Heh-heh-heh-heh-heh.
嘿嘿嘿嘿嘿嘿。

15:24.931 --> 15:27.172
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

15:27.241 --> 15:28.448
[together]
Ha-ha!
[一起]
哈哈！

15:28.517 --> 15:30.551
- [chomps]
- [咀嚼]

15:30.620 --> 15:31.620
- Patrick!
- 帕特里克！

15:31.655 --> 15:32.965
Don't eat your weapon.
别吃你的武器。

15:33.034 --> 15:34.482
- Whoo-hoo!
- 呼呼！

15:34.551 --> 15:36.586
Let's catch us a Creeper.
让我们抓住一只苦力怕吧。

15:36.655 --> 15:38.137
- [babbles]
- [胡言乱语]

15:38.206 --> 15:40.034
[munching]
[咀嚼]

15:41.068 --> 15:43.000
[bird squawking]
[鸟叫声]

15:44.310 --> 15:46.310
- [cackling]
- [咯咯笑]

15:46.379 --> 15:47.620
[all whimpering]
[全都呜咽]

15:47.689 --> 15:49.724
- What is that sound?
- 那是什么声音？

15:51.827 --> 15:55.206
- [gulps] Don't worry, guys.
- [吞咽]别担心，伙计们。

15:55.275 --> 15:58.000
I'll protect you
with my sandwich.
我会保护你
和我的三明治。

15:58.068 --> 16:00.000
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

16:01.000 --> 16:03.517
[yelps]
Oh, no, my sandwich!
[尖叫声]
哦，不，我的三明治！

16:04.586 --> 16:07.172
[stammering]
[结巴]

16:09.137 --> 16:10.482
[whimpering]
[呜咽]

16:10.551 --> 16:11.482
Oh.
哦。

16:11.551 --> 16:12.689
Thanks.
谢谢。

16:15.068 --> 16:17.965
Uh-oh.
呃哦。

16:18.034 --> 16:19.965
[gasps]
[喘气]

16:21.310 --> 16:22.310
- Oh, no.
- 哦，不。

16:22.379 --> 16:24.103
That's Patrick.
那是帕特里克。

16:24.172 --> 16:25.517
He's been snatched.
他被抢走了。

16:25.586 --> 16:26.517
- [cackling]
- [咯咯笑]

16:26.586 --> 16:28.896
[all whimpering]
[全都呜咽]

16:28.965 --> 16:31.517
- Whatever's out
there's going to get us.
- 无论发生什么
会有人来抓我们的。

16:31.586 --> 16:33.862
- That leaves us
only one option.
- 那只剩下我们了
只有一个选择。

16:33.931 --> 16:35.655
- Run!
- 跑步！

16:35.724 --> 16:38.103
[all screaming]
[所有人尖叫]

16:38.172 --> 16:39.241
- No!
- 不！

16:39.310 --> 16:41.172
I was going to say fight back!
我本来想说反击！

16:41.241 --> 16:43.137
- [panting]
- [气喘吁吁]

16:46.068 --> 16:48.103
Sugar Squeezin'.
榨糖啦

16:48.172 --> 16:49.103
Huh?
啊？

16:49.172 --> 16:52.000
Huh?
啊？

16:52.068 --> 16:53.931
[babbling]
[胡说]

16:54.000 --> 16:56.655
For courage.
为了勇气。

16:56.724 --> 16:59.206
- [cackling]
- [咯咯笑]

16:59.275 --> 17:00.344
- Need more courage.
- 需要更多的勇气。

17:00.413 --> 17:01.793
[glugging]
[咕噜咕噜]

17:02.620 --> 17:05.827
- [panting]
- [气喘吁吁]

17:05.896 --> 17:09.517
That Creeper'll never catch me
in my underground tree
那个苦力怕永远抓不到我
在我的地下树里

17:09.586 --> 17:11.241
stump system.
树桩系统。

17:11.310 --> 17:12.344
[chuckles]
[笑声]

17:12.413 --> 17:13.620
[grunts] Huh?
[咕哝]嗯？

17:13.689 --> 17:16.655
I'm caught.
我被抓住了。

17:22.241 --> 17:23.655
- [cackling]
- [咯咯笑]

17:23.724 --> 17:25.137
[thunder crashing]
[雷霆轰鸣]

17:25.206 --> 17:27.000
[birds squawking]
[鸟儿的叫声]

17:28.655 --> 17:30.310
- Stand back!
- 往后站！

17:30.379 --> 17:34.172
I got an electro hammer,
and I'm not afraid to use it!
我有电锤，
我不害怕使用它！

17:34.241 --> 17:35.448
Huh.
呵呵。

17:35.517 --> 17:38.896
[sputtering]
[溅射]

17:39.827 --> 17:43.000
My hammer's gone haywire!
我的锤子失控了！

17:43.068 --> 17:46.000
Time for plan B.
是时候实施 B 计划了。

17:48.310 --> 17:50.034
So long, Creeper!
再见，爬行者！

17:50.103 --> 17:51.241
Whoa!
哇！

17:51.310 --> 17:56.241
[sighs[ Now I know
what a balloon feels like.
[叹气[现在我知道了
气球是什么感觉。

17:57.655 --> 17:59.172
The Clampitheater?
钳形剧场？

17:59.241 --> 18:00.838
Is that where you've been
hiding all the bodies?
那是你去过的地方吗
隐藏所有尸体？

18:00.862 --> 18:02.379
- [cackling]
- [咯咯笑]

18:02.448 --> 18:03.965
- Why are you doing this?
- 你为什么要这样做？

18:04.034 --> 18:08.137
- Because...
this is fun.
- 因为...
这很有趣。

18:08.206 --> 18:09.586
- Elwood?
- 埃尔伍德？

18:09.655 --> 18:11.137
- Hi, Sandy.
- 嗨，桑迪。

18:13.931 --> 18:15.965
- I always wondered
what happened to you.
- 我一直想知道
你发生了什么事。

18:16.034 --> 18:18.551
- It was all those years ago.
——那都是很多年前的事了。

18:18.620 --> 18:22.000
I missed the last bus
home from Kamp Koral
我错过了末班车
坎普·科拉尔的家

18:22.068 --> 18:25.620
on the last day of camp.
在营地的最后一天。

18:25.689 --> 18:27.896
Yay!
耶！

18:27.965 --> 18:31.103
And I've been living
here alone ever since.
而我一直生活在
从此以后就独自一人在这里。

18:31.172 --> 18:32.724
[giggling]
[咯咯笑]

18:32.793 --> 18:34.586
[straining]
[紧张]

18:34.655 --> 18:36.344
It's been fun.
这很有趣。

18:36.413 --> 18:38.206
[chomps]
[咀嚼]

18:38.275 --> 18:39.517
Mmm.
嗯。

18:39.586 --> 18:40.965
[yawns]
[哈欠]

18:41.034 --> 18:41.862
[grunts]
[咕哝]

18:41.931 --> 18:44.172
But I missed all you guys.
但我想念你们所有人。

18:44.241 --> 18:45.724
[roars]
[怒吼]

18:45.793 --> 18:48.655
Then one day, I thought,
if I throw a reunion,
然后有一天，我想，
如果我举办一次聚会，

18:48.724 --> 18:50.862
everyone would come
back to Kamp Koral,
每个人都会来
回到坎普·科拉尔，

18:50.931 --> 18:53.413
and we could play forever.
我们可以永远玩下去。

18:53.482 --> 18:56.379
- Living all by your lonesome
didn't help your social skills
- 独自一人生活
对你的社交技能没有帮助

18:56.448 --> 18:58.206
none, did it?
没有，是吗？

18:58.275 --> 18:59.379
- Nope.
- 没有。

18:59.448 --> 19:01.068
[grunts]
[咕哝]

19:01.137 --> 19:03.482
And here's all our friends.
这是我们所有的朋友。

19:03.551 --> 19:04.586
- Elwood?
- 埃尔伍德？

19:04.655 --> 19:06.000
You did this?
你做了这个吗？

19:06.068 --> 19:08.689
- And you can join them.
- 你可以加入他们。

19:08.758 --> 19:11.034
I have one more guest to fit.
我还有一位客人需要参加。

19:11.103 --> 19:12.379
[giggles]
[咯咯笑]

19:12.448 --> 19:13.379
- [panting]
- [气喘吁吁]

19:13.448 --> 19:15.413
[screaming]
[尖叫]

19:17.379 --> 19:19.551
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

19:19.620 --> 19:21.034
Phew.
唷。

19:21.103 --> 19:22.379
There.
那里。

19:22.448 --> 19:26.344
All that screaming should
keep the Creeper away.
所有的尖叫都应该
让爬行者远离。

19:26.413 --> 19:28.586
- [cackling]
- [咯咯笑]

19:28.655 --> 19:29.655
- I was wrong.
- 我错了。

19:29.689 --> 19:32.206
I need more screaming!
我需要更多的尖叫！

19:32.275 --> 19:34.172
[screaming]
[尖叫]

19:41.586 --> 19:43.413
[screaming]
[尖叫]

19:43.482 --> 19:44.413
Whoa!
哇！

19:44.482 --> 19:46.310
- [growls]
- [咆哮]

19:47.310 --> 19:48.827
[whimpers]
[呜咽]

19:50.034 --> 19:52.862
- [gulps] OK,
I'm sorry I told a story
- [吞咽] 好的，
抱歉我讲了一个故事

19:52.931 --> 19:54.310
with my back to the dark.
我背对着黑暗。

19:54.379 --> 19:57.413
But I never canoodled,
whatever that is.
但我从来没有亲热过，
不管那是什么。

19:57.482 --> 19:58.413
Oh, no.
哦，不。

19:58.482 --> 20:00.724
[screams]
[尖叫声]

20:00.793 --> 20:02.379
Please don't kill me.
请不要杀我。

20:02.448 --> 20:04.137
I'm too young to die.
我还太年轻，还不能死。

20:04.206 --> 20:07.000
I got so many more
Krabby Patties to make.
我还有很多
制作蟹肉饼。

20:10.172 --> 20:12.068
[yelps]
[尖叫声]

20:12.137 --> 20:13.448
[screams]
[尖叫声]

20:13.517 --> 20:16.344
My friends are all dead.
我的朋友都死了。

20:16.413 --> 20:18.517
[all groaning]
[全都呻吟]

20:18.586 --> 20:19.586
No, they're not.
不，他们不是。

20:19.620 --> 20:22.586
They're all zombies.
他们都是僵尸。

20:22.655 --> 20:24.275
- We're not zombies.
- 我们不是僵尸。

20:24.344 --> 20:27.551
We got bored waiting for ya,
so we had a ketchup fight.
我们等你很无聊
所以我们打了一场番茄酱大战。

20:27.620 --> 20:31.586
- [yawns] Then we got
tired and took a nap.
- [哈欠]然后我们得到了
累了就小睡了。

20:31.655 --> 20:34.758
- Oh.
- 哦。

20:34.827 --> 20:37.068
That's exactly what
I would have done.
正是如此
我会这么做的。

20:37.137 --> 20:38.206
Eh!
呃！

20:38.275 --> 20:39.586
- Hey, Elwood!
- 嘿，埃尔伍德！

20:39.655 --> 20:41.000
We're out of ketchup.
我们的番茄酱用完了。

20:43.793 --> 20:45.344
- Elwood?
- 埃尔伍德？

20:45.413 --> 20:47.586
You're the Kamp Creeper?
你是坎普爬行者吗？

20:47.655 --> 20:48.655
- I guess so.
- 大概吧。

20:48.689 --> 20:50.310
Yeah!
是的！

20:50.379 --> 20:52.758
- All of this was his
blundering way of inviting all
——这一切都是他的
邀请所有人的错误方式

20:52.827 --> 20:55.448
of us to a Kamp Koral reunion.
我们一起去参加坎普·科拉尔聚会。

20:55.517 --> 20:57.655
- I have no social skills.
- 我没有社交能力。

20:57.724 --> 20:58.724
Both: Yeah!
两人：是啊！

20:58.758 --> 20:59.965
[nervous chuckles]
[紧张的笑声]

21:00.034 --> 21:04.689
- So, uh, what now?
- 那么，呃，现在怎么办？

21:04.758 --> 21:06.689
- [roars]
- [咆哮]

21:06.758 --> 21:07.758
Ha!
哈!

21:07.793 --> 21:08.896
So what now?
那么现在怎么办？

21:08.965 --> 21:10.655
So let's party.
那么我们来聚会吧。

21:10.724 --> 21:11.724
Hit it!
打吧！

21:11.793 --> 21:14.689
[jazzy music]
[爵士乐]

21:14.758 --> 21:17.448
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

21:17.517 --> 21:19.137
[jellyfishes buzzing]
[水母嗡嗡声]

21:19.206 --> 21:20.689
[microphone feedback]
[麦克风反馈]

21:20.758 --> 21:23.689
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

21:23.758 --> 21:25.241
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

21:25.310 --> 21:26.827
- [hisses]
- [嘶嘶声]

21:26.896 --> 21:29.241
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

21:29.310 --> 21:30.241
- [chomps]
- [咀嚼]

21:30.310 --> 21:32.068
[giggles]
[咯咯笑]

21:32.758 --> 21:36.586
[all imitating conga line chant]
【全部模仿康加线唱诵】

21:36.655 --> 21:38.689
- [laughing]
- [笑]

21:38.758 --> 21:40.689
- Yee-hoo!
- 耶胡！

21:40.758 --> 21:41.931
- Woo-hoo-hoo!
- 呜呜呜！

21:47.586 --> 21:48.931
- [hisses]
- [嘶嘶声]

21:49.000 --> 21:52.620
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

21:52.689 --> 21:53.793
all: ♪ Kamp Koral ♪
全部： ♪ 坎普·科拉尔 ♪

21:53.862 --> 21:55.896
♪ Elwood kidnapped everyone ♪
♪ 埃尔伍德绑架了所有人 ♪

21:55.965 --> 21:57.620
♪ Kamp Koral ♪
♪ 坎普·科拉尔 ♪

21:57.689 --> 21:59.620
♪ Now the party has begun ♪
♪ 现在聚会开始了 ♪

21:59.689 --> 22:00.862
♪ Kamp Koral ♪
♪ 坎普·科拉尔 ♪

22:00.931 --> 22:02.586
♪ We thought we'd be killed ♪
♪ 我们以为我们会被杀 ♪

22:02.655 --> 22:07.896
♪ Instead we're so thrilled
right down to our toes ♪
♪ 相反，我们非常兴奋
一直到我们的脚趾♪

22:07.965 --> 22:10.862
Whee!
哎哟！

22:12.034 --> 22:14.517
- Great party, lad.
- 很棒的聚会，小伙子。

22:14.586 --> 22:18.103
Uh, listen, eh, I was wondering
when you were going to show me
呃，听着，呃，我想知道
当你要给我看的时候

22:18.172 --> 22:19.655
where me lost treasure is.
我丢失的宝藏在哪里。

22:19.724 --> 22:20.655
Heh-heh.
呵呵。

22:20.724 --> 22:21.724
You know.
你知道。

22:21.793 --> 22:23.034
- You're looking at it.
- 你正在看着它。

22:23.103 --> 22:25.137
I spent it on this party.
我把钱都花在了这个聚会上。

22:25.206 --> 22:28.068
Didn't you get the
nickel change I sent you?
你没收到吗
我给你找零钱了？

22:28.137 --> 22:29.793
And besides...
而且除此之外...

22:29.862 --> 22:31.379
- Don't say it.
- 别说出来。

22:33.793 --> 22:37.000
- Aren't friends
the real treasure?
- 不是朋友
真正的宝藏？

22:39.275 --> 22:40.551
Noooo!
不！

22:40.620 --> 22:43.793
- [babbling]
- [胡言乱语]

22:43.862 --> 22:45.862
[thunder crashes]
[雷霆轰鸣]

[雷霆轰鸣]